libdecaf
------------------------------------------
Ed448-Goldilocks is a new elliptic curve for cryptography.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libdecaf-devel-1.0.5-1bl1
  libdecaf0-1.0.5-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://sourceforge.net/projects/ed448goldilocks/

Canonical download:
  mirror://sourceforge/ed448goldilocks/libdecaf-1.0.5.tgz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libdecaf-1.0.5-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libdecaf-1.0.5-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libdecaf-1.0.5-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdecaf-1.0.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdecaf0-1.0.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdecaf-devel-1.0.5-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

